sebuah wabah menyapu kota-kota

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,662
di game online.

4
00:00:04,682 --> 00:00:05,746
Sampai lembaga kesehatan

5
00:00:05,766 --> 00:00:06,958
Amerika ikut bertanya.

6
00:00:06,978 --> 00:00:08,658
Gamenya World of Warcraft.

7
00:00:08,678 --> 00:00:10,052
Tiga belas September 2005,

8
00:00:10,072 --> 00:00:11,213
