15
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:20,169
dan seharusnya hilang begitu

16
00:00:20,189 --> 00:00:21,188
bos dikalahkan.

17
00:00:21,208 --> 00:00:22,349
Masalahnya ada di hewan

18
00:00:22,369 --> 00:00:23,362
peliharaan.

19
00:00:23,382 --> 00:00:24,476
Pemain bisa menyimpan pet

20
00:00:24,496 --> 00:00:25,529
mereka di tengah pertarungan.

21
00:00:25,549 --> 00:00:26,937
Developer lupa memasang tombol

22
00:00:26,957 --> 00:00:28,315
