26
00:00:31,570 --> 00:00:32,918
wabah pun menyebar.

27
00:00:32,938 --> 00:00:34,482
Damage-nya dua ratus enam

28
00:00:34,502 --> 00:00:35,952
puluh tiga sampai tiga ratus

29
00:00:35,972 --> 00:00:37,175
tiga puluh tujuh poin setiap

30
00:00:37,195 --> 00:00:37,957
dua detik.

31
00:00:37,977 --> 00:00:39,365
Karakter level tertinggi bisa

32
00:00:39,385 --> 00:00:40,480
mati dalam tiga puluh detik

33
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,374
