34
00:00:41,394 --> 00:00:42,891
NPC juga tertular,

35
00:00:42,911 --> 00:00:44,303
tapi tidak bisa mati.

36
00:00:44,323 --> 00:00:45,634
Mereka jadi pembawa tanpa

37
00:00:45,654 --> 00:00:46,700
