38
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,140
Reaksi pemainnya mirip dunia

39
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,281
nyata.

40
00:00:49,301 --> 00:00:51,417
Ada healer yang jadi relawan

41
00:00:51,437 --> 00:00:52,398
di kota.

42
00:00:52,418 --> 00:00:53,621
Ada yang berjaga di pinggir

43
00:00:53,641 --> 00:00:54,921
