44
00:00:54,941 --> 00:00:56,208
lain supaya tidak masuk.

45
00:00:56,228 --> 00:00:57,044
Ada juga yang sengaja

46
00:00:57,064 --> 00:00:58,111
menularkan diri,

47
00:00:58,131 --> 00:00:59,454
lalu datang ke keramaian.

48
00:00:59,474 --> 00:01:01,048
Blizzard mencoba karantina dan

49
00:01:01,068 --> 00:01:02,178
